metadata: ObjectMeta?

/// BeyondtrustWorkloadCredentialsDynamicSecretSpec defines the desired spec for
/// BeyondtrustWorkloadCredentials dynamic generator. This generator enables obtaining temporary,
/// short-lived credentials from BeyondTrust Workload Credentials. For more information, see:
/// https://docs.beyondtrust.com/bt-docs/docs/secrets-api
spec: Spec?

/// BeyondtrustWorkloadCredentialsDynamicSecretSpec defines the desired spec for
/// BeyondtrustWorkloadCredentials dynamic generator. This generator enables obtaining temporary,
/// short-lived credentials from BeyondTrust Workload Credentials. For more information, see:
/// https://docs.beyondtrust.com/bt-docs/docs/secrets-api
class Spec {
  /// Controller selects the controller that should handle this generator. Leave empty to use the default
